# Cases whose expectation is in defined/ (make-pickbestseed-goldens.sh defined): an upstream-bug
# fix (BUGS.md, pickbestseed, 2026-09-27) changes their output.  addPointsInGaps searched domains
# 0..numNeighbors (not the candidate's neighbours) for accepted points and kept only the last
# "too close" verdict; computeAreaFracs weighted rings by (2*ring + delr)*delr instead of the
# annulus area (2*ring + 1)*delr^2 -- these change the gap-filling picks, hence seed.mod and the
# phase counts.  dens also: the density plot's grid points outside the area were malloc residue
# (defined 0).  control17: -control 17 read the never-filled wsums array (native hangs).
# err_elong: a track with no points left imin stale and read past an empty contour (native
# segfaults); such a track is given no domain.
base
density
verbose
clusters
oldclust
nobeef
control
control17
bound
boundcount
